{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.NegativePeel"],"declarations":22,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.jonesFn_peel_neg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.jonesFn_peel_neg","kind":"theorem","line":216,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L216-L231","doc":"**Move II⁻ is killed too**, by the same two constants. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.jonesFn_peel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.jonesFn_peel","kind":"theorem","line":202,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L202-L214","doc":"**Move II⁺ is killed.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.jonesFn_conj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.jonesFn_conj","kind":"theorem","line":195,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L195-L200","doc":"**Move I.** The strand count and the writhe are both conjugation-invariant, and the trace is\ncyclic, so the correction changes nothing. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.jonesFn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.jonesFn","kind":"def","line":188,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L188-L193","doc":"**The framing-corrected trace** `J(β) = A^{n} · B^{writhe β} · tr_w(β)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.framing_constants_unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.framing_constants_unique","kind":"theorem","line":174,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L174-L184","doc":"**The constants are pinned, not chosen.** The two move conditions are two equations in `A`\nand `B`, and they determine `A·B` and `A·B⁻¹` outright — hence `A²` and `B²`. Any other\nadmissible pair differs by a sign. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.framing_neg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.framing_neg","kind":"theorem","line":167,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L167-L172","doc":"**The II⁻ condition.** `A · B⁻¹ · z⁻ = 1` with `z⁻ = qi·wi`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.framing_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.framing_pos","kind":"theorem","line":160,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L160-L165","doc":"**The II⁺ condition.** `A · B · z⁺ = 1` with `z⁺ = q³·wi`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.val_writheFactor_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.val_writheFactor_inv","kind":"theorem","line":155,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L155-L158","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.val_writheFactor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.val_writheFactor","kind":"theorem","line":150,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L150-L153","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.val_strandFactor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.val_strandFactor","kind":"theorem","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L147-L148","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.writheFactor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.writheFactor","kind":"def","line":144,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L144-L145","doc":"**The writhe factor** `B = q⁻²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.strandFactor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.strandFactor","kind":"def","line":140,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L140-L142","doc":"**The strand-count factor** `A = (1 + q²)·q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.wUnit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.wUnit","kind":"def","line":136,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L136-L138","doc":"The total weight `1 + q²` as a unit, from `(1 + q²) · wi = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.qUnit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.qUnit","kind":"def","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L132-L134","doc":"`q` as a unit, from `q · qi = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.braidWritheZ_braidTower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.braidWritheZ_braidTower","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L117-L126","doc":"Adding an inert strand does not change the writhe. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.braidWritheZ_conj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.braidWritheZ_conj","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L112-L115","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.braidWritheZ_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.braidWritheZ_inv","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L107-L110","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.braidWritheZ_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.braidWritheZ_mul","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L102-L105","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.braidWritheZ_gen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.braidWritheZ_gen","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L97-L100","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.braidWritheZ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.braidWritheZ","kind":"def","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L93-L95","doc":"The writhe of a braid on `m+1` strands, as an integer. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.writhe_braidGen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.writhe_braidGen","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L87-L89","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.writhe","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalisation.writhe","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/JonesNormalisation.lean#L75-L85","doc":"**The writhe** — the exponent sum of a braid word, as a homomorphism.\n\nWell defined on the presented group precisely because `M` is symmetric: an Artin relation\nequates alternating words of lengths `M i j` and `M j i`, which under a constant assignment\nbecome the same power. ","signatureChunk":0}]}